OL,5,G1600 Jarvis Cocker
OL,6,     FJarvis shares some song
OL,7,     Frecommendations from the people
OL,8,     Fclosest to him. He also has
OL,9,     Fbirthday nods to Mick Jagger,
OL,10,     FAldous Huxley and Stanley Kubrick.
